  * Tooling: tests run under a coverage floor; CI checks the shell scripts.
  * Tooling: a guard fails if a translated string never reached its catalog.
  * Tooling: the app-helper D-Bus contract is pinned by a test.
  * Tooling: a script verifies the sandbox of the privileged helper.
  * Tooling: shipped languages come from po/, not from hardcoded lists.

