gpu-switcher (0.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix: the helper no longer exits during a long polkit dialog; its operation lock is released after unexpected errors instead of leaving it answering Busy.
  * Fix: udev rule conflicts are detected when the tag is assigned after a match on the same line or on a continued line; TAG!= is no longer flagged.
